==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~10 seconds<sup>60f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use strong [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attack Cats]] like [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] with meatshields to destroy the massive amount of Gories. Teacher Bear isn't much of a problem in this stage, but if you are worrying about him, [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] may be a good choice to bring along.

